    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόβρῠχα</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under water,</i>
			
